OL,3,GNEWSAMum sets up women's group to help
OL,4,Afight loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Merseyside mother who set up a
OL,7,Fcommunity group for women experiencing
OL,8,Fanxiety and loneliness said the
OL,9,Fresponse had been "a miracle".
OL,11,FBecky Saunders, 39, from Litherland,
OL,12,Fsaid she set up the group Girls Who
OL,13,FGather, after experiencing 14 months of
OL,14,Fsevere anxiety.
OL,16,F"I just couldn't get away from it," she
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,F"I went to therapy, on walks, read
OL,20,Fbooks, listened to podcasts.
